    {
      "id": "r20261115-a01",
      "title": "Dika's New Bicycle",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Dika got a new bicycle for his birthday. It is red, with a small bell on the handlebar. His father gave it to him on Saturday morning.",
        "At first, Dika was afraid. The bicycle looked too tall. His father held the back of the seat and ran beside him. \"Keep your eyes forward,\" his father said. After an hour, Dika could ride alone to the end of the street.",
        "Now Dika rides his bicycle every afternoon. He rides to the small shop to buy bread for his mother, and he always rings his bell when he passes his friends. His father smiles every time he sees him."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "birthday": "ulang tahun",
        "bell": "bel",
